what is TA Allocation: Each professor teaching btech students is assigned with some teaching assistants(mtech and phd studnets) based on his/her requirements, batch size, course, etc. 
1. Each prof. submits his demand of TA: like i need 5 TA and good to have ram, shyam, rahul, abc, xyz.
2. The admin sees the demand of all profs and based on the avaiability of number of TA assigns TA to each prof. 

